Author:     Lore Agent <lore-agent@re-cinq.com>
AuthorDate: Fri Sep 25 15:40:16 2026 +0000
Commit:     Lore Agent <lore-agent@re-cinq.com>
CommitDate: Fri Sep 25 15:40:16 2026 +0000

    fix(orchestrator): call onError for every rejection, not only Error instances

    A non-Error rejection (string, plain object, undefined) bypasses onError
    because the catch gated on `error instanceof Error`. Wrap any non-Error in
    a new Error with `{cause: error}` before passing it to the hook, keeping
    `throw error` unchanged so the caller still receives the original value.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
